B.ahc=new A.ag("How do I buy coins?","Go to Account > Wallet > Buy Coins and pick a package. Payment is handled by Google Play, or Pesapal checkout on Android where Play in-app purchases aren't available.")
B.ah8=new A.ag("How do payouts work?","Creators can request a payout of eligible coins from Account > Payouts, once a verified payout method is on file.\n\nCoins become eligible for payout 7 days after being earned. Payouts are reviewed and processed manually, typically within a few business days of your request.")
